{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n306\nEverything else is empty phrases, empty promises, and\npostponement to the Greek calends. Once we take the\ninitiative, we shall speed up work on all sides, and only\nthen shall we prepare the programme of the Third Inter-\nnational.\nWritten  not  later  than\nSeptember  3  (16),  1917\nFirst  published  in\nPublished  according  to\nLenin  Miscellany  VII,  1928\nthe  manuscript", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "306", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.59, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "Everything else is empty phrases, empty promises, and", "x": 13.9, "y": 9.53, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "postponement to the Greek calends. Once we take the", "x": 11.11, "y": 11.47, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "initiative, we shall speed up work on all sides, and only", "x": 11.11, "y": 13.39, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "then shall we prepare the programme of the Third Inter-", "x": 11.11, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "national.", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.27, "w": 11.52, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 13.87, "y": 21.16, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "not", "x": 22.4, "y": 21.16, "w": 3.08, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "later", "x": 26.43, "y": 21.16, "w": 4.47, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "than", "x": 31.85, "y": 21.16, "w": 4.29, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "September", "x": 13.81, "y": 22.49, "w": 10.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "3", "x": 25.04, "y": 22.55, "w": 0.94, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 27.02, "y": 22.49, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "16", "x": 27.82, "y": 22.55, "w": 1.91, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 29.96, "y": 22.49, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 32.24, "y": 22.55, "w": 3.95, "h":